                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'> - week, from which country started Full-roll-out OR after which it had 80% adoption rate &gt; 80% for 4 weeks</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>Start week 10 </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>- week, from which country started Part Roll-out OR after which it had  adoption rate &gt; 10% for 4 weeks</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
