                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'> ------</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>IDP PO Lines, % </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>- IDP adoption rate - qty of PO lines (skus) created based on IDP</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'> recomendation / all PO lines created </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>Unedited PO Lines, % </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>- qty of PO lines (skus) where order qty matches with recomendation qty / total qty of PO lines (skus) created based on IDP</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'> recomendation </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>Recomendation changes, % </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'> - show how significant are the changes in POs = SUM (ABS (recomended qty - ordered qty) / SUM(recomended qty ) - only for lines, where there was a change</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'>WAPE</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontname='Segoe UI' fontsize='10'> calculated only for products with 100% hourly availability</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
